Programs the worker runs
------------------------

  openEMS, CSXCAD and nf2ff
    Compiled from source, unmodified, and installed under /usr/local, with their Python
    bindings in /usr/local/venv. The source is the upstream repository at one commit:
      https://github.com/thliebig/openEMS-Project
      commit f73bf97906a38ef1693f59f311ce13cc1b531474, with its submodules
    /usr/share/doc/emi-worker/openems-source.txt lists that commit and each submodule's.
    The build recipe is worker/openems-image/Dockerfile in the EMI Analyzer repository.
    License: GPL-3.0-or-later (openEMS, nf2ff), LGPL-3.0-or-later (CSXCAD)
    Used by the experimental full-wave solve.
    An image built with OPENEMS_SOURCE=apt has the Debian package openems instead (with
    libopenems0, libcsxcad0, libnf2ff0), whose source is found as below.

  nec2c
    Debian package nec2c
    License: GPL-2.0-or-later
    Used by the cable budget and the cable-resonance check.

  ngspice
    Debian package ngspice
    License: BSD-3-Clause
    Used by the ESD transient simulation.

Python packages
---------------

  gerbonara (Apache-2.0), numpy (BSD-3-Clause), h5py (BSD-3-Clause), httpx (BSD-3-Clause),
  httpcore (BSD-3-Clause), websockets (BSD-3-Clause), mapbox_earcut (ISC), PyYAML (MIT),
  anyio (MIT), h11 (MIT), idna (BSD-3-Clause), certifi (MPL-2.0), and their dependencies.
  The exact list is in /usr/share/doc/emi-worker/python-packages.txt.

The base system
---------------

The image is built on Debian 12 (bookworm). Every Debian package in it carries its licence
and copyright notice in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright. The exact package versions are in
/usr/share/doc/emi-worker/debian-packages.txt.

Source code
-----------

The complete corresponding source for every Debian package in the image, at the exact
version installed, is published by Debian:

  https://sources.debian.org/src/<package>/<version>/
  https://snapshot.debian.org/package/<package>/<version>/

or, on any Debian system with source repositories enabled:

  apt-get source <package>=<version>

For openEMS, CSXCAD and nf2ff the complete corresponding source is the upstream commit
named above and in openems-source.txt, together with the build recipe
(worker/openems-image/Dockerfile) at the EMI Analyzer release the image was built from.

